CodexHost sidebar stash (收纳箱)
================================

Ported from ump45nose/codex-stash (MIT), Copyright (c) 2026 ump45nose.

The TypeScript sources under this directory reimplement that extension's
behavior for CodexHost's renderer-extension. No LaunchAgent or standalone
userscript files from that repository are bundled here.

Third-party ideas acknowledged by the upstream project (no source copied):
- Codexion (MIT) — locator / idempotent install patterns
- Codex App HUD (MIT) — active-thread probe attribute
- Explodex — public note of data-app-action-sidebar-* attribute names
